This file is a placeholder. The licence for this product is the last step of
the rewrite, not the first: it is chosen by the owner only once
`tools/licence_audit.py` passes on a built tree (phase 8), and the choice is
recorded in `NOTES.md` with the date and the audit's output. Until then no
copying, modification or distribution of this software is permitted.

Third-party material shipped alongside this software keeps its own licence;
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` is the list.
